==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|finickier|finickiest|more}}

# [[fastidious|Fastidious]] and [[fussy]]; difficult to [[please]]; [[exacting]], especially about [[detail]]s; [[meticulous]] and [[particular]]; grumpy, agitated, irritated until satisfied or comfortable; likely to fidget; 

====Usage notes====
* The forms {{term|finickier}} and {{term|finickiest}} also exist, but are quite rare, and perhaps nonstandard. The forms {{term||more finicky}} and {{term||most finicky}} are much more common, and certainly standard.

====Synonyms====
* See [[wikisaurus:fastidious]]

====Examples====
* The baby was finicky until the action of his/her diaper change had been completed.; The toddler was finicky until a suitable sleeping position had been discovered.

===See also===
* [[finickity]]

